  "about_item": [
    "【Orthopedic Care & Ultra-Thick Support】 Create a cozy retreat for your dog with this ultra-thick orthopedic bed designed for maximum comfort. It is filled with thick, resilient shredded foam, twice as thick as conventional products, and will not deform or sag over time. This superior design effectively cushions joints and reduces spinal pressure, providing relief for dogs suffering from arthritis or mobility issues.",
    "【Ergonomic Slant Dog Couch 】Our slant dog couch provides targeted biomechanical support to align your dog’s cervical and thoracic spine, reducing neck stiffness from prolonged rest. It redistributes weight across the sloped surface to ease pressure on shoulders, elbows, and hips—critical for dogs with arthritis or hip dysplasia. The gentle head elevation keeps deep-chested breeds’ airways clear and uses gravity to prevent gastric reflux, promoting safer, more comfortable sleep after meals.",
    "【Ultra Soft & Calming Sleep Surface】 The sleep surface of this dog bed is crafted with a luxurious fish-scale pattern and durable textured fabric for long-lasting use. This ultra-soft, skin-friendly material delivers a gentle, calming sensation that helps relieve anxiety and promote deep sleep, turning every nap into a peaceful, comfortable retreat.",
    "【Removable Cover & Easy to Clean】 This washable dog bed features a fully removable cover with a reliable zipper for easy removal. When accidents or dirt occur, simply unzip and machine wash the cover on a gentle cycle. It will refresh and look like new every time, ensuring your furry friend always has a clean, hygienic resting space.",
    "【Anti-Slip Bottom】 For your peace of mind and your dog's comfort, the bottom of this large dog bed is equipped with a high-grip rubber dot pattern. It locks the bed in place on hard floors, preventing sudden slips or shifts that could startle or injure your pet. This ensures a stable, secure resting spot they can trust.",
    "【Important Notice】 Our dog bed is vacuum-packed for shipping. Simply shake and fluff by hand after unboxing. Please allow 24–48 hours for it to fully expand to its best shape."
  ],
