        "title": "Perfect for my recovering Labrador",
        "text": "I purchased the FURTIME XXL bed for my large Labrador to provide a safe and comfortable bed while he recuperates from a TPLO surgery. What is especially nice about the bed is that the sides are gradually elevated making it easier for my pup to navigate while providing him with some extra padding. As soon as I put the bed on the floor he immediately adopted it as his new haven. The choice of this bed has worked out extremely well. Bed is well made and should last for years.",
